  m_Name: Story4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Value: 'Look, as your creator, mentor, god, and everything that is dear to you,
    my advice is this: There''s a very useful thing in the back of this room, you''re
    gonna need it. Oh, and please don''t get in the pipe behind you. No really, I
    knew you''d climb in there, so I made you fat so you couldn''t.'
